  "question": {
    "text": "The distance <math><mi>x</mi></math> covered by a paritcle in one dimensional motion varies with time <math><mi>t</mi></math> as <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math> . If the acceleration of the particle depends on <math><mi>x</mi></math> as <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></math> , where <math><mi>n</mi></math> is an integer, the value of <math><mi>n</mi></math> is _________"
  },
